WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,460 --> 00:00:04,140
Wait and listen to me

2
00:00:04,740 --> 00:00:06,220
It seems like you are not members of the Guan family.

3
00:00:06,620 --> 00:00:07,740
But the people in the world, right?

4
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:10,900
How is it

5
00:00:11,140 --> 00:00:12,060
If you are a member of the Guan family

6
00:00:12,060 --> 00:00:13,100
I died speechless

7
00:00:13,660 --> 00:00:15,020
But if you are a member of the Jianghu community,

8
00:00:15,140 --> 00:00:16,500
Then someone must have used certain conditions

9
00:00:16,500 --> 00:00:17,420
