15
00:00:30,890 --> 00:00:34,210
Is that master dead? He's dead?

16
00:00:36,740 --> 00:00:37,900
Big boss you can do it

17
00:00:37,900 --> 00:00:38,980
Before that guy

18
00:00:38,980 --> 00:00:46,930
But it screwed me up, old ghost

19
00:00:47,560 --> 00:00:49,400
Your medical skills are much more reliable than those of your studies

20
00:00:49,880 --> 00:00:53,480
My medical skills are inherently more reliable than studying

21
00:00:58,970 --> 00:01:00,330
This is the mission goal

22
00:01:01,730 --> 00:01:03,330
I'm about to solve it
